      <activity id="3f691d3b-a2b8-53db-aeb1-c41276bd3ecf" activityNameId="106d8b5e-1002-50ce-9f55-821dbcdca857" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="1">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Non-ferrous metal smelter</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Non-ferrous metal smelter
The module is designed for unspecific use. It is based on inventories from aluminium and iron industry. Lifetime: 50a, input: 6'750'000 t ore concentrate (39%), output: 2'650'000 t metal per year;
UUID: 5fb9a181-182d-3a35-9710-691b4979f74e
Includes facilities for roasting, electrolysis and for the blast furnace and converter processes.
Location: No geographical context, inventory based on calculations
Technology: Infrastructure modules from aluminium and iron production are chosen as proxy: aluminium oxide, plant / aluminium hydroxide, plant / electrolysis, plant / blast furnace / blast furnace converter.  Their output have been scaled to fit average operations.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5fb9a181-182d-3a35-9710-691b4979f74e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
